{"title": "Mystra's Blessing", "pageid": 27979, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Mystra's_Blessing", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Bugs", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Mystra's Blessing</b> is a passive feature which boosts the wielder's <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bless\" title=\"Bless\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c4/Bless_Icon.webp/20px-Bless_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c4/Bless_Icon.webp/30px-Bless_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c4/Bless_Icon.webp/40px-Bless_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bless\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c4/Bless_Icon.webp/20px-Bless_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c4/Bless_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bless\" title=\"Bless\">Bless</a> spell.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Creatures you <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bless\" title=\"Bless\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c4/Bless_Icon.webp/20px-Bless_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c4/Bless_Icon.webp/30px-Bless_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c4/Bless_Icon.webp/40px-Bless_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bless\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c4/Bless_Icon.webp/20px-Bless_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c4/Bless_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bless\" title=\"Bless\">Bless</a> also gain <a href=\"/wiki/Mystra%27s_Blessing_(Staff_of_Arcane_Blessing)_(Condition)\" title=\"Mystra's Blessing (Staff of Arcane Blessing) (Condition)\">Mystra's Blessing</a> for an additional 1d4 bonus to spell attack rolls.<sup><i>[<a class=\"mw-selflink-fragment\" href=\"#Bugs\">See: Bugs</a>]</i></sup> \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span id=\"Condition:_Mystra.27s_Blessing_.28Staff_of_Arcane_Blessing.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Mystra's_Blessing_(Staff_of_Arcane_Blessing)\"> Condition: Mystra's Blessing (Staff of Arcane Blessing) </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mystra%27s_Blessing_(Staff_of_Arcane_Blessing)_(Condition)\" title=\"Mystra's Blessing (Staff of Arcane Blessing) (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Bless_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Bless_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Bless_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Bless_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Bless_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Bless_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mystra's Blessing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Bless_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Bless_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/87/Bless_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mystra%27s_Blessing_(Staff_of_Arcane_Blessing)_(Condition)\" title=\"Mystra's Blessing (Staff of Arcane Blessing) (Condition)\">Mystra's Blessing</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 10  turns</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>+1d4 to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Rolls</a> made with spells</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the weapons:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Staff_of_Arcane_Blessing\" title=\"Staff of Arcane Blessing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/91/Magic_Staff_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Magic_Staff_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/91/Magic_Staff_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Magic_Staff_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/91/Magic_Staff_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Magic_Staff_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/91/Magic_Staff_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Magic_Staff_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/91/Magic_Staff_A_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Staff_of_Arcane_Blessing\" title=\"Staff of Arcane Blessing\">Staff of Arcane Blessing</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>The in-game description of this passive feature is not entirely correct, and reads as follows:</li></ul>\n<blockquote style=\"font-size:130%; font-family:Georgia;\"><i> Bless grants an additional 1d4 to Saving Throws and Weapon Attack Rolls, and an additional 2d4 to Spell Attack Rolls. </i></blockquote>\n<ul><li>Instead, creatures Blessed with the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Staff_of_Arcane_Blessing\" title=\"Staff of Arcane Blessing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/91/Magic_Staff_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Magic_Staff_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/91/Magic_Staff_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Magic_Staff_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/91/Magic_Staff_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Magic_Staff_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/91/Magic_Staff_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Magic_Staff_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/91/Magic_Staff_A_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Staff_of_Arcane_Blessing\" title=\"Staff of Arcane Blessing\">Staff of Arcane Blessing</a> gain two separate conditions:\n<ul><li>The regular <a href=\"/wiki/Bless_(Condition)\" title=\"Bless (Condition)\">Bless condition</a>, which grants a 1d4 bonus to all saving throws and attack rolls.</li>\n<li>The special <a href=\"/wiki/Mystra%27s_Blessing_(Staff_of_Arcane_Blessing)_(Condition)\" title=\"Mystra's Blessing (Staff of Arcane Blessing) (Condition)\">Mystra's Blessing condition</a>, which grants another 1d4 bonus, but only to spell attack rolls.</li></ul></li></ul>\n<ul><li>Specifically, it is possible to lose the regular Bless condition (due to the caster losing <a href=\"/wiki/Concentration\" title=\"Concentration\">concentration</a>) while retaining the Mystra's Blessing condition. In this case, the creature is left with a 1d4 bonus to spell attack rolls, but loses the other 1d4 bonuses, despite the tooltip of the condition claiming otherwise.</li></ul>\n<ul><li>Mystra's Blessing is only applied when Bless is cast using a level 1 or level 2 spell slot, in addition to the once-per-day version granted by the staff itself.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714200633\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.059 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.066 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2139/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 21834/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 9143/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.021/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 986014/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   57.555      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   57.555      1 -total\n 30.98%   17.829      1 Template:PageSeo\n 30.45%   17.525      1 Template:Hidden_code\n 24.31%   13.990      2 Template:SmSAI\n